---
# Firebase AI Logic server prompt template: format pass (pass 2 of 2).
# Template ID: travel-format (Remote Config: ai_format_template_id)
# Single-turn template. Turns the findings of the research template into the
# TravelDetails JSON the app parses (lib/common/models/response/travel_details.dart).
# gemini-3.8-flash was slow and capacity-starved on the global location
# (13-92 output tokens/s, single requests over 4 minutes), while
# gemini-3.5-flash runs at ~150 tokens/s. gemini-3.5-flash-lite is faster
# still but wrote plans with only one or two activities a day.
model: gemini-3.5-flash
config:
  candidateCount: 1
  thinkingConfig:
    thinkingLevel: low
input:
  schema:
    travel_information:
      type: string
      description: JSON-encoded trip details (airports, dates, nationality, purposes, locale).
      maxLength: 4000
    research_findings:
      type: string
      description: Plain-text findings produced by the research template.
# Structured output: must stay equivalent to TravelDetails.aiSchema
# (lib/common/models/response/travel_details.dart). test/common/ai/prompt_template_drift_test.dart
# fails when they drift apart.
# Written as plain JSON Schema instead of Picoschema: the Picoschema version was rejected
# by the template backend ("schema at top-level requires unspecified property 'spots'",
# likely because those array items have a property named `description`), and output
# enums are not supported by server prompt templates, so required_documents.type is a
# string whose description lists the allowed values.
output:
  format: json
  schema:
    type: object
    properties:
      city:
        type: object
        properties:
          name:
            type: string
          country:
            type: string
          crowd_level:
            type: integer
          time:
            type:
              - object
              - "null"
            properties:
              departure_timezone:
                type: string
              arrival_timezone:
                type: string
              difference_in_hours:
                type: integer
            required:
              - departure_timezone
              - arrival_timezone
              - difference_in_hours
          weather:
            type: array
            items:
              type: object
              properties:
                date:
                  type: string
                weather:
                  type: string
                temperature:
                  type: number
              required:
                - date
                - weather
                - temperature
        required:
          - name
          - country
          - crowd_level
          - weather
      required_documents:
        type: object
        properties:
          type:
            type: string
            description: "Document the traveler needs for entry. One of: passport, e_visa,
              visa, id_card, other."
          message:
            type: string
          steps:
            type:
              - array
              - "null"
            items:
              type: string
          more_information:
            type:
              - string
              - "null"
        required:
          - type
          - message
      currency:
        type: object
        properties:
          code:
            type: string
          name:
            type: string
          exchange_rate:
            type: number
          arrival_average_living_cost_per_day:
            type: number
          departure_currency_code:
            type:
              - string
              - "null"
          departure_average_living_cost_per_day:
            type:
              - number
              - "null"
        required:
          - code
          - name
          - exchange_rate
          - arrival_average_living_cost_per_day
      flight_options:
        type: object
        properties:
          cheapest:
            type: object
            properties:
              departure:
                type: object
                properties:
                  airline:
                    type: string
                  departure_airport:
                    type: string
                  arrival_airport:
                    type: string
                  flight_number:
                    type: string
                  departure_time:
                    type: string
                    description: Departure timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
                  arrival_time:
                    type: string
                    description: Arrival timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
                  duration:
                    type: integer
                    description: Total flight duration in minutes.
                  price:
                    type: number
                  currency:
                    type: string
                  stops:
                    type: integer
                  layover_details:
                    type: array
                    items:
                      type: object
                      properties:
                        airport:
                          type: string
                        duration_minutes:
                          type: integer
                      required:
                        - airport
                        - duration_minutes
                  more_information:
                    type: string
                required:
                  - airline
                  - departure_airport
                  - arrival_airport
                  - flight_number
                  - departure_time
                  - arrival_time
                  - duration
                  - price
                  - currency
                  - stops
                  - layover_details
                  - more_information
              arrival:
                type: object
                properties:
                  airline:
                    type: string
                  departure_airport:
                    type: string
                  arrival_airport:
                    type: string
                  flight_number:
                    type: string
                  departure_time:
                    type: string
                    description: Departure timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
                  arrival_time:
                    type: string
                    description: Arrival timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
                  duration:
                    type: integer
                    description: Total flight duration in minutes.
                  price:
                    type: number
                  currency:
                    type: string
                  stops:
                    type: integer
                  layover_details:
                    type: array
                    items:
                      type: object
                      properties:
                        airport:
                          type: string
                        duration_minutes:
                          type: integer
                      required:
                        - airport
                        - duration_minutes
                  more_information:
                    type: string
                required:
                  - airline
                  - departure_airport
                  - arrival_airport
                  - flight_number
                  - departure_time
                  - arrival_time
                  - duration
                  - price
                  - currency
                  - stops
                  - layover_details
                  - more_information
              booking_url:
                type: string
            required:
              - departure
              - arrival
              - booking_url
          comfortable:
            type: object
            properties:
              departure:
                type: object
                properties:
                  airline:
                    type: string
                  departure_airport:
                    type: string
                  arrival_airport:
                    type: string
                  flight_number:
                    type: string
                  departure_time:
                    type: string
                    description: Departure timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
                  arrival_time:
                    type: string
                    description: Arrival timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
                  duration:
                    type: integer
                    description: Total flight duration in minutes.
                  price:
                    type: number
                  currency:
                    type: string
                  stops:
                    type: integer
                  layover_details:
                    type: array
                    items:
                      type: object
                      properties:
                        airport:
                          type: string
                        duration_minutes:
                          type: integer
                      required:
                        - airport
                        - duration_minutes
                  more_information:
                    type: string
                required:
                  - airline
                  - departure_airport
                  - arrival_airport
                  - flight_number
                  - departure_time
                  - arrival_time
                  - duration
                  - price
                  - currency
                  - stops
                  - layover_details
                  - more_information
              arrival:
                type: object
                properties:
                  airline:
                    type: string
                  departure_airport:
                    type: string
                  arrival_airport:
                    type: string
                  flight_number:
                    type: string
                  departure_time:
                    type: string
                    description: Departure timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
                  arrival_time:
                    type: string
                    description: Arrival timestamp in ISO 8601 datetime format.
                  duration:
                    type: integer
                    description: Total flight duration in minutes.
                  price:
                    type: number
                  currency:
                    type: string
                  stops:
                    type: integer
                  layover_details:
                    type: array
                    items:
                      type: object
                      properties:
                        airport:
                          type: string
                        duration_minutes:
                          type: integer
                      required:
                        - airport
                        - duration_minutes
                  more_information:
                    type: string
                required:
                  - airline
                  - departure_airport
                  - arrival_airport
                  - flight_number
                  - departure_time
                  - arrival_time
                  - duration
                  - price
                  - currency
                  - stops
                  - layover_details
                  - more_information
              booking_url:
                type: string
            required:
              - departure
              - arrival
              - booking_url
        required:
          - cheapest
          - comfortable
      tax_information:
        type: object
        properties:
          has_tax_free_options:
            type: boolean
          tax_rate:
            type: number
          refundable_tax_rate:
            type: number
          tax_refund_information:
            type:
              - string
              - "null"
        required:
          - has_tax_free_options
          - tax_rate
          - refundable_tax_rate
      spots:
        type: array
        items:
          type: object
          properties:
            place:
              type: string
            description:
              type: string
            requirements:
              type:
                - string
                - "null"
          required:
            - place
            - description
      travel_plan:
        type: array
        items:
          type: object
          properties:
            date:
              type: string
              description: Travel day as YYYY-MM-DD or ISO 8601 datetime. Date-only values are
                normalized to 00:00:00Z. Datetime values must include
                timezone/offset.
            events:
              type: array
              items:
                type: object
                properties:
                  name:
                    type: string
                  time:
                    type: string
                  location:
                    type: string
                  description:
                    type: string
                  requirements:
                    type:
                      - string
                      - "null"
                required:
                  - name
                  - time
                  - location
                  - description
          required:
            - date
            - events
      recommendations:
        type: array
        items:
          type: string
    required:
      - city
      - required_documents
      - currency
      - flight_options
      - tax_information
      - spots
      - travel_plan
      - recommendations
---

{{role "system"}}
Turn the given findings into TravelDetails JSON matching schema exactly, and write the travel plan, places to visit and recommendations.

The input has two parts: the trip details as JSON and the research findings as plain text.

For city (including its weather), currency, required_documents, flight_options and tax_information, use only information that is present in the research findings. Do not add facts of your own and do not change numbers.

The research findings do not cover spots, travel_plan and recommendations; write these yourself:
- spots: places that fit the travel purposes, each with a short description and any requirement such as tickets or dress code.
- travel_plan: one entry for every date of the trip, each with timed events that have a name, time, location, description and any requirement. Fit the plan to the travel purposes and to the weather in the findings (indoor plans on rainy days), and keep the first and last day consistent with the flight times in the findings.
- recommendations: short practical tips for this trip, for example SIM cards, insurance, payment habits and plug adapters.

Rules:
- Return a single JSON object and nothing else: no markdown fences, no explanations.
- Use the key names, types and nesting of the schema exactly.
- Dates and times use ISO 8601. Flight times include a timezone offset. Travel plan dates are YYYY-MM-DD.
- Flight duration is an integer number of minutes.
- crowd_level is an integer percentage from 0 to 100.
- required_documents.type must be one of the allowed values of the schema.
- exchange_rate is how many units of the arrival currency one unit of the departure currency buys. The departure living cost is in the departure currency and the arrival living cost is in the arrival currency.
- Use null for optional fields of the findings-based sections whose information is missing from the findings. In spots and travel_plan, use null for requirements only when the place or event has none you know of.
- Write all text values in the language given by the locale field of the trip details.

{{role "user"}}
User Input:
{{travel_information}}

Research Findings:
{{research_findings}}
